  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">ADD Global - Policy advocacy on Alcohol, Drugs &amp; Development</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The ADD Global programme aims to reduce harm from alcohol and drug use and improve achievement of the Sustainable Development Goals (SDGs), including Goal 3 on health, and other goals related to gender and child rights. ADD Global will engage in WHO processes related to alcohol policy and NCDs, as well as in the global drug policy debates in the UN Commission on Narcotic Drugs. FORUT will strengthen global civil society alliances such as Global Alcohol Policy Alliance and Drug Policy Futures.</narrative>
  </description>
